Decorative icons, layout wrappers, `<Label>`s that duplicate their input's accessible name, the demo-accounts hint text on the login page, the `asLink={false}` category badge on CategoryPage (the `<h1>` already carries the name), and all 60+ untouched `components/ui/*` shadcn primitives.

